# T-800 routing (scoped)

Правка `agents/`, `skills/`, `commands/`, `rules/`, `hooks/` — только `/t800-start` или `/t800-fix` → `Task(t-800-factory)`. Не ad-hoc в main chat.

Команды: `/t800-bootstrap` `/t800-doctor` `/t800-update`. Gates: `t800_factory_bypass_gate.py`, `t800_run_gate.py`.

Память: `{memory_path}`. Плагин: `~/.cursor/plugins/local/t-800-agent/`.
